x=\"6\" cy=\"0\" fill=\"#b4261f\"/><circle r=\"10\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"-7\" fill=\"#d23a2f\"/><circle r=\"4\" fill=\"#24170c\"/></g></g><g class=\"sw1\" style=\"transform-origin:560px 375px\"><path d=\"M560 375 Q564 378 560 318\" stroke=\"#4f6b3a\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" fill=\"none\"/><g transform=\"translate(560 318)\"><circle r=\"11\" cx=\"-6\" cy=\"0\" fill=\"#c8302f\"/><circle r=\"11\" cx=\"6\" cy=\"0\" fill=\"#b4261f\"/><circle r=\"10\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"-7\" fill=\"#d23a2f\"/><circle r=\"4\" fill=\"#24170c\"/></g></g><g class=\"sw2\" style=\"transform-origin:588px 375px\"><path d=\"M588 375 Q592 323 588 263\" stroke=\"#4f6b3a\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" fill=\"none\"/><g transform=\"translate(588 263)\"><circle r=\"11\" cx=\"-6\" cy=\"0\" fill=\"#c8302f\"/><circle r=\"11\" cx=\"6\" cy=\"0\" fill=\"#b4261f\"/><circle r=\"10\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"-7\" fill=\"#d23a2f\"/><circle r=\"4\" fill=\"#24170c\"/></g></g><g class=\"sw0\" style=\"transform-origin:607px 375px\"><path d=\"M607 375 Q611 301 607 241\" stroke=\"#4f6b3a\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" fill=\"none\"/><g transform=\"translate(607 241)\"><circle r=\"11\" cx=\"-6\" cy=\"0\" fill=\"#c8302f\"/><circle r=\"11\" cx=\"6\" cy=\"0\" fill=\"#b4261f\"/><circle r=\"10\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"-7\" fill=\"#d23a2f\"/><circle r=\"4\" fill=\"#24170c\"/></g></g><g class=\"sw1\" style=\"transform-origin:640px 375px\"><path d=\"M640 375 Q644 327 640 267\" stroke=\"#4f6b3a\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" fill=\"none\"/><g transform=\"translate(640 267)\"><circle r=\"11\" cx=\"-6\" cy=\"0\" fill=\"#c8302f\"/><circle r=\"11\" cx=\"6\" cy=\"0\" fill=\"#b4261f\"/><circle r=\"10\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"-7\" fill=\"#d23a2f\"/><circle r=\"4\" fill=\"#24170c\"/></g></g><g class=\"sw2\" style=\"transform-origin:670px 375px\"><path d=\"M670 375 Q674 304 670 244\" stroke=\"#4f6b3a\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" fill=\"none\"/><g transform=\"translate(670 244)\"><circle r=\"11\" cx=\"-6\" cy=\"0\" fill=\"#c8302f\"/><circle r=\"11\" cx=\"6\" cy=\"0\" fill=\"#b4261f\"/><circle r=\"10\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"-7\" fill=\"#d23a2f\"/><circle r=\"4\" fill=\"#24170c\"/></g></g><g class=\"sw0\" style=\"transform-origin:699px 375px\"><path d=\"M699 375 Q703 334 699 274\" stroke=\"#4f6b3a\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" fill=\"none\"/><g transform=\"translate(699 274)\"><circle r=\"11\" cx=\"-6\" cy=\"0\" fill=\"#c8302f\"/><circle r=\"11\" cx=\"6\" cy=\"0\" fill=\"#b4261f\"/><circle r=\"10\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"-7\" fill=\"#d23a2f\"/><circle r=\"4\" fill=\"#24170c\"/></g></g><g class=\"sw1\" style=\"transform-origin:715px 375px\"><path d=\"M715 375 Q719 339 715 279\" stroke=\"#4f6b3a\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" fill=\"none\"/><g transform=\"translate(715 279)\"><circle r=\"11\" cx=\"-6\" cy=\"0\" fill=\"#c8302f\"/><circle r=\"11\" cx=\"6\" cy=\"0\" fill=\"#b4261f\"/><circle r=\"10\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"-7\" fill=\"#d23a2f\"/><circle r=\"4\" fill=\"#24170c\"/></g></g>\n</svg></div>\n<div class=\"plate-cap\">Plate I &middot; The Family Album</div>\n<div class=\"plate-sub\">Poppies in the wind, the day before Veterans Day</div></div>\n<div class=\"part\"><span>The News</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"sec\">The National Wire</h2>\n<div class=\"wire lead\"><div><span class=\"kick\">The Lead</span><h3>Gas Drops Below $4</h3>\n<p>The national average for a gallon of regular fell to about $3.98 on Tuesday, the first time it has been under $4 in nearly four months, AAA says, CBS reports. It was $4.56 earlier this year.</p>\n<p>The fall is mostly seasonal: from Sept. 15, stations may sell a cheaper \"winter blend\" of gasoline, and people drive less once vacation season ends. Patrick De Haan of GasBuddy, which tracks pump prices, expects prices to keep easing into Thanksgiving travel.</p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wire\"><div class=\"num\">3</div><div><h3>Update: The FBI and Nvidia's Boss</h3><p>President Trump said the FBI is looking into the affair of Jensen Huang, head of AI chip giant Nvidia, with a woman U.S. agencies suspect was a Chinese spy, the BBC reports. Trump said Huang told him, \"I had no idea she was a spy,\" and that he believes him; China calls the allegations \"entirely groundless.\"</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wire\"><div class=\"num\">4</div><div><h3>Ukraine Talks Resume</h3><p>American, Ukrainian and Russian negotiators began two days of talks in Abu Dhabi on Tuesday aimed at ending the war Russia started in 2022, the first such meeting since February, CBS reports. They will focus on security guarantees, promises of protection Ukraine wants against a future attack.</p></div></div>\n<h2 class=\"sec\">The Home Wire</h2>\n<div class=\"wire\"><div class=\"num\">1</div><div><h3>New York &middot; Regents Exams Stay Until 2030</h3><p>The Board of Regents pushed back the end of the state's Regents exams to 2030, WXXI reports. Students will still take one each in English, math, science and social studies, but the tests won't decide whether they graduate.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wire\"><div class=\"num\">2</div><div><h3>Dunkirk &middot; Pomfret Water Brings Money</h3><p>Homes and businesses in Pomfret east and south of the Routes 20 and 60 roundabout moved off Fredonia's troubled water system on Friday and now get Dunkirk's water through the North County Water District, the <i>Observer</i> reports. \"That will be extra income for the city of Dunkirk,\" Public Works Director Randy Woodbury said.</p></div></div>\n<h2 class=\"sec\">The Marquee</h2>\n<div class=\"wire\"><div class=\"num\">1</div><div><h3>Billy Joel Plans a Return</h3><p>Billy Joel will answer students' questions and play \"a little music\" at Florida Atlantic University on Dec. 14, his first official appearance since he was diagnosed with normal pressure hydrocephalus, a brain disorder, and left the stage last year, Rolling Stone reports. Tickets go only to enrolled students.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wire\"><div class=\"num\">2</div><div><h3>Johnny Depp's Scrooge</h3><p>Early reactions to <i>Ebenezer</i>, Johnny Depp's take on <i>A Christmas Carol</i>, are mostly warm after press screenings and a London premiere Monday night, Variety reports, with critics calling it a \"wickedly fun holiday treat\" and a strong comeback for its star. Full reviews come out Thursday, and the film opens in theaters Friday, Nov. 13.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wire\"><div class=\"num\">3</div><div><h3>Fall Out Boy Hit the Road</h3><p>Fall Out Boy announced a 36-date 2027 stadium-and-arena tour of Europe and North America and released \"ACES,\" their first new song in more than three years, Billboard reports. The North American leg runs 21 stadium dates from July 13 to Aug. 26, including Toronto's Rogers Stadium and Citi Field in Queens, with The Offspring and Good Charlotte along.</p></div></div>\n<h2 class=\"sec\">The Gridiron</h2>\n<div class=\"wire\"><div><h3>Bills 23, Vikings 6</h3><p>Buffalo held the ball for 42 minutes to Minnesota's 17 and wore the Vikings down. Josh Allen threw a 25-yard touchdown pass late in the first half, James Cook carried 31 times for 107 yards and ran one in from 5 in the fourth, and Tyler Bass kicked three field goals, the longest from 52. The defense intercepted two passes and held Minnesota to 178 yards. The Bills are 7&ndash;1.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wire\"><div><h3>Jets Make a Deadline-Week Trade</h3><p>Ahead of today's 4 p.m. trade deadline, the Jets sent backup safety Andre Cisco to Detroit for a 2028 sixth-round pick, Gang Green Nation reports. Pass rusher Will McDonald has asked for a trade, though coach Aaron Glenn suggested the team isn't looking to move him.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wire\"><div><h3>The Sunday Tax &middot; Week 10</h3><p>Picks at <a href=\"https://tally.so/r/RGOakJ\">tally.so/r/RGOakJ</a>; standings at <a href=\"https://benthambulletin.github.io/pool/\">benthambulletin.github.io/pool</a>. $5 a week, straight-up winners, the pot to the best record. Anyone with the link can play. Sheets lock at each kickoff; first game Thursday at 8:15. Week 9 went to Devin, a perfect 15&ndash;0, for the $95 pot.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"part\"><span>The Almanac</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"sec\">The Weather Glass</h2>\n<p class=\"wlede\">Mostly sunny and windy, ten degrees above normal</p>\n<div class=\"wxrow\">\n  <div class=\"wxc\"><div class=\"k\">Tonight</div><div class=\"v\">37&deg;</div><div class=\"s\">partly cloudy</div></div>\n  <div class=\"wxc\"><div class=\"k\">Wind</div><div class=\"v\">35 mph</div><div class=\"s\">W gusts</div></div>\n  <div class=\"wxc\"><div class=\"k\">Rain</div><div class=\"v\">2%</div><div class=\"s\">dry today</div></div>\n  <div class=\"wxc\"><div class=\"k\">Normal</div><div class=\"v\">50&deg;</div><div class=\"s\">for the date</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"towns\">\n  <div class=\"town\"><div class=\"n\">North Tonawanda</div><div class=\"t\">50<sup>&deg;</sup></div><div class=\"d\">Mostly clear<br>high 60&deg;</div></div>\n  <div class=\"town\"><div class=\"n\">Dunkirk</div><div class=\"t\">46<sup>&deg;</sup></div><div class=\"d\">Clear<br>high 57&deg;</div></div>\n  <div class=\"town\"><div class=\"n\">Scottsville</div><div class=\"t\">45<sup>&deg;</sup></div><div class=\"d\">Mostly cloudy<br>high 61&deg;</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"towns lakes\">\n  <div class=\"town\"><div class=\"n\">Lake Erie</div><div class=\"t\">57<sup>&deg;</sup></div><div class=\"d\">off Buffalo, Monday</div></div>\n  <div class=\"town\"><div class=\"n\">Lake Ontario</div><div class=\"t\">57<sup>&deg;</sup></div><div class=\"d\">off Rochester, Monday</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"strip5\">\n  <div><div class=\"d\">Tue</div><div class=\"i\">&#9728;</div><div class=\"h\">60</div><div class=\"w\">mostly sunny</div></div>\n  <div><div class=\"d\">Wed</div><div class=\"i\">&#9925;</div><div class=\"h\">55</div><div class=\"w\">showers late</div></div>\n  <div><div class=\"d\">Thu</div><div class=\"i\">&#127783;</div><div class=\"h\">48</div><div class=\"w\">rain</div></div>\n  <div><div class=\"d\">Fri</div><div class=\"i\">&#127783;</div><div class=\"h\">42</div><div class=\"w\">chance of showers</div></div>\n  <div><div class=\"d\">Sat</div><div class=\"i\">&#127784;</div><div class=\"h\">44</div><div class=\"w\">chance of snow</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"lbl t\">Next 24 hours</span></div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 62\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:420px;height:auto;margin:0 auto .4rem\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Hourly temperatures for North Tonawanda over the next 24 hours, from 50 now to a high of 60 and a low of 38\"><polyline points=\"12.0,34.7 24.9,32.2 37.7,29.6 50.6,28.4 63.5,27.1 76.3,24.5 89.2,23.3 102.1,23.3 115.0,22.0 127.8,24.5 140.7,27.1 153.6,29.6 166.4,33.5 179.3,36.0 192.2,38.5 205.0,41.1 217.9,42.4 230.8,44.9 243.7,46.2 256.5,47.5 269.4,50.0 282.3,50.0 295.1,50.0 308.0,50.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#9c3216\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"115.0\" cy=\"22.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#9c3216\"/><text x=\"115.0\" y=\"16.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#24170c\">60&deg;</text><circle cx=\"269.4\" cy=\"50.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#2f5e3e\"/><text x=\"264.4\" y=\"44.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#24170c\">38&deg;</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#6b5a48\">now</text><text x=\"308\" y=\"61\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"Archivo,Arial\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#6b5a48\">this time tomorrow</text></svg>\n<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"lbl t\">Outdoor window</span> Today, the last dry 60 in the forecast.</div>\n<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"lbl t\">Snow watch</span> Friday night's showers may mix with snow after 10, low around 31, with a chance of snow showers Saturday morning.</div>\n<h2 class=\"sec\">The Almanac Sky</h2>\n<div class=\"wxrow\">\n  <div class=\"wxc\"><div class=\"k\">Moon</div><svg class=\"moonmini\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"46\" fill=\"#5a4d3b\"/><path d=\"M50 4 A46 46 0 0 1 50 96 A44.1 46 0 0 0 50 4Z\" fill=\"#f4e5b4\"/></svg><div class=\"s\">thin crescent</div></div>\n  <div class=\"wxc\"><div class=\"k\">Sunrise</div><div class=\"v\">7:01</div><div class=\"s\">a.m.</div></div>\n  <div class=\"wxc\"><div class=\"k\">Daylight</div><div class=\"v\">9h 56m</div><div class=\"s\">2 min less</div></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"skynote\"><b>Tonight:</b> a 2 percent crescent, the first after Monday's new moon, follows the sun down at 5:21, too thin and low to catch for most. Saturn holds the southern sky around 10. The Beaver Moon is full Tuesday, Nov. 24.</p>\n<div class=\"touch-head\">The Stars &middot; for fun</div>\n<div class=\"stars slim\">\n<div class=\"star\"><span class=\"sgn\">Aries</span> <span class=\"who\">Kaylani, Luka</span><br>Easy, steady energy. The hard thing on the list gets done today.</div>\n<div class=\"star\"><span class=\"sgn\">Cancer</span> <span class=\"who\">Gregg</span><br>A quiet day in the sky for you. Quiet is underrated.</div>\n<div class=\"star\"><span class=\"sgn\">Leo</span> <span class=\"who\">Leah, Tommy</span><br>Good fun and good company line up. Say yes to the plan.</div>\n<div class=\"star\"><span class=\"sgn\">Virgo</span> <span class=\"who\">Derek, Joanne</span><br>Plans and moods bump into each other. Bend a little.</div>\n<div class=\"star\"><span class=\"sgn\">Scorpio</span> <span class=\"who\">Ariel, Claire, Garret</span><br>The moon has moved on from your sign, and so can you. Let yesterday's thing go.</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"sec\">Coming Up</h2>\n<div class=\"calbox\"><div class=\"calrow\"><div class=\"cd\">Wed</div><div>Veterans Day</div></div>\n<div class=\"calrow\"><div class=\"cd\">Thu</div><div>Sunday Tax sheets start locking, 8:15</div></div>\n<div class=\"calrow\"><div class=\"cd\">Sun</div><div>Bills at Jets, 1:00</div></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"sec\">The Ledger</h2>\n<div class=\"ledger\"><div class=\"num\"><div class=\"cap\">Gordon Ramsay's new age, as of Sunday</div><div class=\"big\">60</div></div>\n<div class=\"txt\">The chef marked it with a shirtless workout photo and \"Day 2 of being 60,\" E! News reports. He shares the birthday with his daughter Tilly, who turned 25.</div></div>\n<h2 class=\"sec\">On This Day</h2>\n<div class=\"otd\"><b>November 10, 1975</b> &mdash; The ore freighter <i>Edmund Fitzgerald</i> went down in a November gale on Lake Superior with all 29 of her crew.</div>\n<h2 class=\"sec\">Question of the Day</h2>\n<div class=\"qotd\">I fly without wings, I climb highest on a windy day, and if you let go of my string, I'm gone. What am I? <i>Answer below the fold.</i></div>\n<div class=\"dbl\"><div class=\"a\"></div><div class=\"b\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"colo\"><div class=\"s\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><b>Question of the Day:</b> A kite.</div>\n<div class=\"s\">Forecast, lake temperatures and radar per NWS Buffalo &middot; Niagara Falls, Dunkirk and Rochester stations &middot; normals from NOAA &middot; sky computed for 14120 &middot; headlines via CBS, the BBC, WXXI, the Dunkirk <i>Observer</i>, E! News, Rolling Stone, Variety, the Hollywood Reporter, Billboard, Gang Green Nation, ProFootballTalk, AP &middot; scores and stats via Sportradar &middot; pool from the Sunday Tax standings</div>\n<div class=\"ask\"><a href=\"https://tally.so/r/rjxDpl\">Send something to the paper</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://tally.so/r/obWNYP\">Log a migraine</a></div>\n<div class=\"sig\">&mdash; G.</div><div class=\"orn\">&#127809; &#127810; &#127809;</div></div>\n",
